Hey @Tholin how's the chip! 

@namibj  things going well? 

@RebelMike excited to see if your run 2 chip could be used in the freework motherboard! 

@asic destroyer thanks for introducing us to machdyne! 

 @Nikola @J-Lo Excited to see your USB 2.0 implementation on an async logic device! 

@Andrew Wingate @psychogenic @Tim 'mithro' Ansell thanks for supporting us! 

@baragonaru Excited for you to meet everyone working with DeepAI's slots!

@Tholin  is anyone making a "characterization" chip for probing with leads

Has anyone asked John mcmaster what the requirements for a chip to be probe-able this way are? 

it would be great to get the physical silicon questions answered this way, if possible, and ensure it's all really probe-able
